## 🎯 Quick Start Guide

### Step 1: Basic Version (No Backend)
```
1. Download index.html, style.css, script.js
2. Create a folder: portfolio/
3. Put all files in that folder
4. Open index.html in browser
5. Customize with your information
```

### Step 2: Add Images
```
1. Create images/ folder in project
2. Add profile.jpg (350x350px)
3. Add project1.jpg, project2.jpg, project3.jpg
4. Update image paths in HTML
```

### Step 3: Customize Content
```html
<!-- Change these in index.html -->
- Logo: "[YourName.dev]"
- Name: "Hi, I am [Your Name]"
- Description: "A Creative Full-Stack Developer"
- Projects: Add your actual projects
- Email: Update contact info
- Social links: Add LinkedIn, GitHub, Twitter
```

### Step 4: Deploy (Choose One)

#### Option A: Netlify (Free, No Backend)
1. Create account at netlify.com
2. Drag and drop folder
3. Domain assigned automatically

#### Option B: GitHub Pages
1. Create repository
2. Push files to main branch
3. Go to Settings > Pages
4. Select main branch
5. Site live in minutes

#### Option C: Shared Hosting (With PHP)
1. Get hosting with PHP/MySQL support
2. Upload via FTP
3. Setup database
4. Configure contact-handler.php
5. Test contact form

#### Option D: VPS/Dedicated Server
1. Install Node.js/PHP
2. Setup domain with DNS
3. Install SSL certificate
4. Deploy files
5. Setup database
6. Monitor and maintain

